  "ruleText": "Saf-C 522.01 Vehicle Eligibility. Multi-Use decal plates shall be issued to passenger or recreational vehicles as provided in RSA 261-B:5 and RSA 261-C:5.\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 523.01)",
